Package: globepbcpexa
Title: GLOBE Score for Primary Biliary Cholangitis (Lammers 2015) - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Transplant-free survival at 3, 5, 10 and 15 years for patients
    with primary biliary cholangitis treated with ursodeoxycholic acid, from
    the original continuous GLOBE score (Lammers et al., Gastroenterology 2015
    <doi:10.1053/j.gastro.2015.07.061>). Implemented from the published
    equation. For research use; not a medical device.
